        "original_id": "83336cf9-9073-5b3f-a97f-e30b4c49d23e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Milburn Stone, Norman Macdonnell, John Meston\n- Works: Gunsmoke\n- Roles: Doc, Dr. Galen Adams\n- Organizations: CBS\n- Topics: American film and television acting, radio and television Western drama\n\nFacts:\n- Milburn Stone was born on July 5, 1904.\n- Gunsmoke is an American radio and television Western drama series created by director Norman Macdonnell and writer John Meston.\n- Milburn Stone, sometimes known as Milly Stone, was an American film and television actor.\n- Milburn Stone was best known for playing Doc, also called Dr. Galen Adams, on the CBS western series Gunsmoke.\n- Milburn Stone died on June 12, 1980.",
